@lrf=1|aud=GPT-5.6|scope=documentation
R|doc.ia|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|preserve project information architecture unless redesign requested
R|doc.entry|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|brief intro; prerequisites setup common usage easy to locate
R|doc.readme-layout|file:README.md|MUST|LW_SCOPE|when README creation or restructuring is requested include a title and concise what prerequisites and usage; add language navigation only when multilingual content is requested; link to applicable existing detail docs
R|doc.detail|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|put real long architecture/data/state material in focused docs and link it
R|doc.bundle|case:explicit-doc-bundle|MUST|LW_SCOPE|create only the user-requested document count and names; use README as the entry point and put state ER shared-memory or other deep material in dedicated docs only when applicable
R|doc.placeholder|*|MUST_NOT|LW_SCOPE|create placeholder diagrams ER/state files or fixed sections for a global template
R|doc.precision|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|state assumptions environments and commands precisely; prefer checkable examples
R|doc.secret|*|MUST_NOT|CRED|track live credentials or expose secrets in examples reports terminal excerpts screenshots
R|doc.secret-found|event:secret-found|MUST|RO_LOCAL|STOP and report; history rewrite or tracked-file removal needs explicit approval
R|doc.effects|*|MUST_NOT|LW_SCOPE|infer commit tag release deploy DB/memory write external message or security scan authority from docs work
R|doc.skill-contract-detect|event:skill-scan&file:SKILL.md|MUST|RO_LOCAL|check=purpose-preserving-morphism+LRF-effect-contract; missing-or-incomplete=>case:skill-contract-gap; syntax-decoration-alone=insufficient
R|doc.skill-contract-repair|event:skill-scan&case:skill-contract-gap|MUST|LW_SCOPE|authorization=repair-inspected-SKILL.md-only; preserve=name,description,capability,invocation-policy,user-intent; add-or-refine=morphism+LRF-contract; unrelated-files=false
R|doc.skill-contract-morphism|event:skill-scan&file:SKILL.md|MUST|LW_SCOPE|form=Obj(input-context)→Mor(operation)→Obj(result-evidence); recommend=mathematical-symbols+emoji-trigger-cues; cues=presentation-and-retrieval-only; legibility=LLM-first+human-auditable
R|doc.skill-contract-trigger|event:skill-scan&file:SKILL.md|MUST|LW_SCOPE|express=trigger⊕precondition⊕effect⊕stop⊕success; recommended-cues=🔎trigger,⊢precondition,→effect,⛔stop,✅success; equivalent-clear-symbols=allowed
R|doc.skill-contract-authority|event:skill-scan&file:SKILL.md|MUST|LW_SCOPE|authority,effects,safety,negation,exceptions,completion=LRF-records-only; mathematical-symbols-or-emoji-as-sole-safety-carrier=false; unknown-LRF-structure=STOP
R|doc.skill-contract-scope|event:skill-scan&case:skill-contract-gap|MUST_NOT|LW_SCOPE|broaden-skill-trigger,grant-new-external-effect,change-provider,change-credentials,change-production,change-VCS-policy
R|doc.skill-contract-verify|event:skill-scan&case:skill-contract-gap|MUST|LW_SCOPE|check=frontmatter-parse+LRF-six-fields+preserved-links+exact-diff; report=changed-skill+selected-contracts+remaining-unknowns
R|doc.verify|*|MUST|LW_SCOPE|run narrow matching format link snippet schema or render check
R|doc.done|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|confirm local links and filenames inspect exact diff and mark claims needing source verification
R|doc.memory-ingest|event:stop|MUST|LW_SCOPE|at every stop generate Markdown in Codex style and ingest every generated file; use category-specific structure knowledge=H1 Knowledge Base plus api Context Findings Morphism; walkthrough=H1 Walkthrough plus Overview Deliverables Verification; plan=H1 Implementation Plan plus Purpose Components Steps Acceptance Risks; diary=dated H3 plus Hypothesis Tried Rejected Uncertainty Attribution Search Correction Emotion Thoughts and PromptDefect vs AgentDefect; issue=H1 Issues and Roadmap Queue plus status ID Summary Subtasks; rule=title Scope Requirements Procedure Exceptions Verification; decision=Decision Adopted Rejected Rationale Impact Constraints; method=Method Scope Procedure Invariants Verification; history=Date Changes Reason Result Remaining; include one H1 title and explicit plan verified knowledge method prompt-defect agent-defect completion evidence dates uncertainties impact and concise tags; choose one category from knowledge walkthrough rule diary decision method issue history plan at invocation
